~ quick_draw
Sharpshooter: Fancy a game of Quick Draw? Hit Accept the moment you see the "!". Win three of five.
- Let's play
	$> Story.start_minigame("quick_draw")
	if Story.last_minigame_won()
		if Story.flag("quick_draw_won")
			Sharpshooter: Fast as ever!
		else
			$> Story.give_item("tonic")
			$> Story.set_flag("quick_draw_won")
			Sharpshooter: Not bad at all! Here, take this Tonic.
	else
		Sharpshooter: Too slow! Try again any time.
- Not now
	Sharpshooter: Suit yourself.
=> END
